## 8. Event Lifecycle State Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: Event Created
    Draft --> Published: Publish & Send Invites
    Draft --> Cancelled: Cancel Early
    Published --> Scheduled: RSVP Deadline Passed
    Published --> Cancelled: Low Interest
    Scheduled --> InProgress: Event Starts
    Scheduled --> Cancelled: Emergency Cancel
    InProgress --> Completed: All Sessions Done
    Completed --> Reviewed: Trainer Report Uploaded
    Reviewed --> Archived: Admin Approves
    Reviewed --> InProgress: Reopen Issues
    Cancelled --> Archived: Archive After 30 Days

    state Draft {
        [*] --> Editing
        Editing --> [*]
    }
    state Published {
        [*] --> Invites_Sent
        Invites_Sent --> RSVP_Open
        RSVP_Open --> [*]
    }
    state InProgress {
        [*] --> Attendance_Tracking
        Attendance_Tracking --> [*]
    }
```

