## 9. Notification Flow Sequence

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant System as Scoutmate Hub
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Email as Email Service
    participant User as Trainer/School Admin

    System->>DB: Event created (status=draft)
    System->>DB: Trainers assigned

    System->>DB: Event published
    loop For each trainer
        System->>DB: Create notification(type=assignment)
        System->>Email: Queue email notification
    end
    Email-->>User: Email arrives

    loop For each school
        System->>DB: Create notification(type=invitation)
        System->>Email: Queue invitation
    end

    User->>System: Accept/Decline assignment
    System->>DB: Update trainer status
    System->>DB: Create notification for admin

    Note over System: 48 hours before event
    System->>DB: Check upcoming events
    System->>DB: Create reminder notifications
    System->>Email: Queue reminder emails
```

